          "content": "**Core investigation:** Production quality response.\n\n**Unit framework.** When field results shift, multiple stages may be responsible. Accurate timestamps and moisture records can reveal changes invisible in nominal target proportions.\n\n**Capstone evidence task.** Write a root-cause matrix with process inputs, test-system inputs and environmental inputs; include a way to falsify each hypothesis."
