          "content": "## Learning outcomes\n\nAt the end of this unit, explain each of its four topics without substituting a numerical model for measured concrete behavior; solve the displayed material balance or test interpretation with consistent units; choose a verification measurement; and document why a field conclusion may differ from the classroom scenario."
